# Rite of Renewal: Bot1 targets itself as the player, and a Black Lotus is both a card to return and a card to shuffle (CR 608.2c: each sentence is done in turn). The Lotus is in Bot1's hand by the time the shuffling is read, so it is no longer a legal target (CR 400.7, 608.2b) and stays there; the Lightning Bolt and the other Lotus are shuffled into the library (two more cards in it) and the Rite is exiled.

